id: fab
name: Floating action button (FAB, small, large, extended)
category: actions
summary: The one primary action of a screen, floating above content. Rounded square, not a circle.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Standard FAB 56dp, shape large (16dp). Small 40dp shape medium. Large 96dp shape extra-large.
- Extended FAB: 56dp tall, icon plus Label Large text, padding 16dp, same shape as standard.
- Container: primary-container with on-primary-container content. Elevation level 3 (a shadow is justified here because it floats).
- At most one per screen. Place bottom end, 16dp from the edges, above a navigation bar.
@@a11y
- The icon-only FAB needs aria-label naming the action ("Compose", not "Add icon").
- Extended FAB's visible text is its name.
@@html
<button class="md-fab" type="button" aria-label="Create note">
  <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">edit</span>
</button>

<button class="md-fab md-fab--extended" type="button">
  <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">edit</span>
  Compose
</button>
@@css
.md-fab {
  --_bg: var(--md-primary-container);
  --_c: var(--md-on-primary-container);
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--sp-md);
  width: 3.5rem;
  height: 3.5rem;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: var(--shape-lg);
  background-color: var(--_bg);
  color: var(--_c);
  box-shadow: var(--md-elev-3);
  font-family: var(--md-font-plain);
  font-size: var(--md-type-label-large-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-label-large-weight);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-label-large-tracking);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    box-shadow var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    border-radius var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial),
    transform var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial);
}

.md-fab:hover  { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 8%, var(--_bg)); box-shadow: var(--md-elev-4); }
.md-fab:focus-visible { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg)); }
.md-fab:active {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg));
  border-radius: var(--shape-md);
  transform: scale(0.96);
}

.md-fab--small { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: var(--shape-md); }
.md-fab--large { width: 6rem; height: 6rem; border-radius: var(--shape-xl); }
.md-fab--large .md-icon { font-size: 2.25rem; }

.md-fab--extended { width: auto; padding: 0 var(--sp-lg); }
@@notes
The old circular FAB is the pre-Expressive look. Keep the rounded square.
